lines=['# APP06 PR20 / DEV10 approval decisions - verified handoff','', '## A - Environment','', 'Odoo20.0 Community FINAL, Python3.14.6, PostgreSQL18.4 on Windows. Technical addon vendor_price_revision_impact_simulator; dependencies base, product, purchase_stock, sale_stock, mail. Existing20.0 baseline retained after development-start verification against https://nightly.odoo.com/. All runtime fixtures were synthetic in an allowlisted disposable loopback55451 cluster; HTTP and cron disabled; no external services.', '', '## B - Implementation','', 'Authenticated Approve/Reject/Return actions enforce ordered mandatory stages and distinct represented principals plus actual actors. Every decision and finalization rechecks current PR16 reconciliation, PR17 assumptions, PR18 options, frozen policy, source and exact commercial payload. Required reasons, immutable decisions/final artifact, independently authorized company/type/role/time-bound delegation, half-open UTC validity and governed new versions preserve history. Rejection/return cancel future stages; votes never transfer. Internal activities archive with retained references; completion is not approval. Historical APPROVED is separate from current authority. Native JSON encoding and equal-membership M2M order are checked without rewriting old signed PR19 evidence. Same-second revocation retains causal prior-vote IDs under the request lock.', '', '## C - Files changed','', 'Five old integration files: __manifest__.py, models/__init__.py, tests/__init__.py, models/approval_engine.py (routing policy hook only), models/approval.py (activity message only). All other111 previous files, including every old test, are byte-identical to the actual116-file PR19 archive.', '', 'New files: models/approval_decision_math.py (UTC/local expiry); models/approval_decision_policy.py (explicit company policy); models/approval_decisions.py (workflow/evidence/delegation); models/approval_decision_ui.py (guarded wizards/documents/actions); security/approval_decision_security.xml; views/approval_decision_views.xml; tests/test_approval_decisions.py (50 meaningful methods). Design: docs/APPROVAL_DECISION_ENGINE.md. Executable probes, raw logs, archived baseline and static ledger are in evidence/pr20-*.', '', '## D - Actual fixture reference results','', '| Reference | Executed result |','|---|---|','| A | Exposure INR1500; single Purchase stage, one actor, exact final artifact; native price unchanged. |','| B | Exposure INR150000; Purchase then Finance then Director; exactly3 decisions and1 final artifact. |','| C | Finance quorum2: first vote partial; duplicate denied; second distinct person finalizes. |','| D | Finance rejects after Purchase approval; Purchase evidence retained, Director cancelled, no final authorization. |','| E | Return retains original evidence; linked successor starts with zero votes; rejection terminal. |','| F | Submitted INR109 changes to112: Finance blocked, old vote retained as history, source recalculation/new submission/new votes required. |','| G | Maker with Purchase/Finance/Director and full source grants still cannot approve. |','| H | Exact valid-until boundary blocks strict downstream getter; historical approved status retained. |', '', 'These assertions and PR20_REFERENCE_A-H markers are in the update milestone log below; they are synthetic fixture results, not customer approvals.', '', '## E - Approval integrity','', 'The submitted source revision, baseline, scenario/recommendation/option versions, full row commercial snapshots, currency/UoM/quantity/MOQ/date semantics and separate decision policy are frozen with hashes. Quorum counts only immutable approved votes of currently eligible distinct principals/actors. No stage skips or zero quorum. Finalization independently reconstructs the chain and exact payload; database uniqueness plus request/source/user locks and savepoints prevent duplicate votes/artifacts and partial success. Source, permission, policy or time drift removes current authority without erasing old decisions. No default lifetime is invented: source-only or explicitly configured elapsed days/local date. Finalization failure and deadline crossing roll back the new vote.', '', '## F - Security','', 'Global active selected-company and exact source warehouse/native-order rules protect headers and financial detail, grouping and exports. Original-user source permissions apply; no eligibility sudo. The sole new sudo identifies protected attachment metadata following the existing intake guard; actual content/read/stream checks restore the requesting user. Private binary request attachments cannot gain public tokens, be reassigned, replaced or deleted. Direct ORM create/write/delete of immutable decisions/artifacts and fabricated actor/context/stage IDs are denied. Delegation cannot elevate roles or bypass maker/creator/submitter/contributor exclusion; an independent configured governor authorizes it. Tests cover foreign-company manager grouping, lost source grants/roles, portal/public and activity forgery.', '', '## G - Executed verification','', '| Gate | Result / actual count | Evidence |','|---|---|---|']
